1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Give AI a budget for the job, not a wallet full of money.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Human intent becomes a task, a mandate, and a bounded agent path.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Gemini proposes a plan; deterministic AgentLedger policy approves it. Service costs are simulated.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Invalid proposals are blocked, and STOP propagates revocation to queued descendants.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:51,000
The illustrative fixture view shows the same bounded lineage and blocked retry after root revocation.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Arc Mainnet Demo Mode requires a wallet and explicit confirmation for each write; evidence is shown separately.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Recorded lifecycle payment: 0.01 USDC to a separately controlled demo wallet.

8
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Revocation is onchain; retryBlocked was confirmed by a read-only check.

9
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Experimental and unaudited: AI costs are simulated, and outcome hashes do not prove service delivery.
